esting Tabulator-PE\nNotice of Instructions to the Voters-PE\nSample Ballot-PE\nNotice of Election-PE\nDeadline Voter Registration-PE\nPublic Notice – Election Offices 2026\n2022 REDISTRICTING INFORMATION\n2022 Redistricting Commission District Map – Proposed\n2012 Commission District Map – Approved\n2021-03 – 2022 Redistricting Ordinance – First Reading December 23, 2021\n2022 Commission Letter to the Public and Newspapers\nTo Check Your Registration, Voting Location and Sample Ballot – Click on the Link Below:\nhttps://vip.sdsos.gov/VIPLogin.aspx\nhttps://sdsos.gov/elections-voting/default.aspx\nPOLLING PLACES\nVoting Precincts 2012\nCommissioner Districts 2012\n*If you are interested in being a Precinct Worker and assisting with County Elections please call our office*\nCounty Audit Reports\nCharlesMixCounty2024-2023\nCharlesMixCounty2022-2021\nCharlesMixCounty2020-2019\nCharlesMixCounty2018-2017\nCharlesMixCounty2016-2015\nNews\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
